Evaluate the potential impact of geopolitical events (if any) on market sentiment. Assess the S&P 500's volatility (VIX) level. Combine this with information on corporate earnings reports released this week, paying close attention to earnings surprises (positive or negative) and company guidance. If geopolitical risk is low and earnings surprises are generally positive, lean towards a positive sentiment. Increase conviction if volatility is relatively low, suggesting greater certainty in the market. Sentiment near 0 if it is Thursday, news mixed, VIX high.